CSS Grid Properties
--------------------

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CSS Grid Properties</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #1e293b;
}

h1 {
    text-align: center;
    color: #0f172a;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.section {
    background: white;
    padding: 15px;
    margin: 18px auto;
    max-width: 1000px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
}

.property {
    color: #b45309;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    padding: 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.item {
    background: #2563eb;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 8px;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 4px;
    min-width: 0;
}

.three-columns {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
}

.fixed-columns {
    grid-template-columns: 100px 200px 100px;
}

.repeat-columns {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
}

.mixed-columns {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;
}

.two-rows {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 60px 100px;
}

.column-gap {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    column-gap: 25px;
}

.row-gap {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    row-gap: 25px;
}

.center-items {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    justify-items: center;
}

.center-items .item {
    width: 75%;
}

.align-items {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    height: 130px;
    align-items: center;
}

.place-items {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    height: 130px;
    place-items: center;
}

.place-items .item {
    width: 75%;
}

.justify-content {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 100px);
    justify-content: center;
}

.align-content {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 35px 35px;
    height: 130px;
    align-content: center;
}

.place-content {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 100px);
    grid-template-rows: 35px 35px;
    height: 130px;
    place-content: center;
}

.span-column {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
}

.span-column .item:first-child {
    grid-column: span 2;
}

.span-row {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 55px 55px;
}

.span-row .item:first-child {
    grid-row: span 2;
}

.area-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;
    grid-template-areas: "left main right";
}

.left  { grid-area: left; }
.main  { grid-area: main; }
.right { grid-area: right; }

.named-area {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    grid-template-areas:
        "header header"
        "sidebar content"
        "footer footer";
}

.header  { grid-area: header; }
.sidebar { grid-area: sidebar; }
.content { grid-area: content; }
.footer  { grid-area: footer; }

.auto-flow {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 45px);
}

.auto-rows {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: 70px;
}

.auto-columns {
    grid-template-columns: 100px 100px;
    grid-auto-columns: 100px;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
}

.auto-fit {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
}

.grid-shorthand {
    grid: auto-flow 50px / repeat(3, 1fr);
}

.small-item {
    padding: 8px 3px;
}

.note {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #475569;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    body {
        padding: 10px;
    }

    .three-columns,
    .repeat-columns,
    .mixed-columns,
    .two-rows,
    .column-gap,
    .row-gap,
    .center-items,
    .align-items,
    .place-items,
    .span-column,
    .span-row,
    .area-grid,
    .auto-flow {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .area-grid {
        grid-template-areas: "left main" "right right";
    }

    .named-area {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        grid-template-areas:
            "header"
            "sidebar"
            "content"
            "footer";
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>CSS Grid Properties</h1>
<p style="text-align:center">Simple examples for students</p>

<section class="section">
<h2>1. display: grid</h2>
<p class="note">Creates a Grid container.</p>
<div class="grid three-columns">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>2. grid-template-columns</h2>
<p class="note">Sets the number and width of columns.</p>
<div class="grid fixed-columns">
<div class="item">100px</div><div class="item">200px</div><div class="item">100px</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>3. repeat() and fr</h2>
<p class="note">repeat(3, 1fr) creates three equal-width columns.</p>
<div class="grid repeat-columns">
<div class="item">1fr</div><div class="item">1fr</div><div class="item">1fr</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>4. Different fr values</h2>
<p class="note">grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr</p>
<div class="grid mixed-columns">
<div class="item">1fr</div><div class="item">2fr</div><div class="item">1fr</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>5. grid-template-rows</h2>
<p class="note">Sets the height of rows.</p>
<div class="grid two-rows">
<div class="item">Row 1</div><div class="item">Row 1</div>
<div class="item">Row 2</div><div class="item">Row 2</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>6. gap</h2>
<p class="note">Adds space between rows and columns.</p>
<div class="grid three-columns" style="gap:20px">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>7. column-gap</h2>
<p class="note">Adds horizontal space between columns.</p>
<div class="grid column-gap">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>8. row-gap</h2>
<p class="note">Adds vertical space between rows.</p>
<div class="grid row-gap">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>9. grid-column</h2>
<p class="note">Makes an item span multiple columns.</p>
<div class="grid span-column">
<div class="item">Spans 2 columns</div>
<div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div><div class="item">4</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>10. grid-row</h2>
<p class="note">Makes an item span multiple rows.</p>
<div class="grid span-row">
<div class="item">Spans 2 rows</div>
<div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div><div class="item">4</div>
<div class="item">5</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>11. justify-items</h2>
<p class="note">Aligns items horizontally inside their grid cells.</p>
<div class="grid center-items">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>12. align-items</h2>
<p class="note">Aligns items vertically inside their grid cells.</p>
<div class="grid align-items">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>13. place-items</h2>
<p class="note">Sets align-items and justify-items together.</p>
<div class="grid place-items">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>14. justify-content</h2>
<p class="note">Aligns the whole grid horizontally inside its container.</p>
<div class="grid justify-content">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>15. align-content</h2>
<p class="note">Aligns the whole grid vertically when extra space exists.</p>
<div class="grid align-content">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>16. place-content</h2>
<p class="note">Sets align-content and justify-content together.</p>
<div class="grid place-content">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>17. grid-template-areas and grid-area</h2>
<p class="note">Names grid areas and places items into those areas.</p>
<div class="grid area-grid">
<div class="item left">Left</div>
<div class="item main">Main</div>
<div class="item right">Right</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>18. Multiple named areas</h2>
<p class="note">Useful for headers, sidebars, content and footers.</p>
<div class="grid named-area">
<div class="item header">Header</div>
<div class="item sidebar">Sidebar</div>
<div class="item content">Content</div>
<div class="item footer">Footer</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>19. grid-auto-flow</h2>
<p class="note">Controls how automatically placed items fill the grid.</p>
<div class="grid auto-flow">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>20. grid-auto-rows</h2>
<p class="note">Sets the size of rows created automatically.</p>
<div class="grid auto-rows">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>21. grid-auto-columns</h2>
<p class="note">Sets the size of columns created automatically.</p>
<div class="grid auto-columns">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div>
<div class="item">3</div><div class="item">4</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>22. minmax() and auto-fit</h2>
<p class="note">Creates flexible columns that adjust to available space.</p>
<div class="grid auto-fit">
<div class="item">Card 1</div><div class="item">Card 2</div>
<div class="item">Card 3</div><div class="item">Card 4</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>23. grid shorthand</h2>
<p class="note">Sets row and column layout in one declaration.</p>
<div class="grid grid-shorthand">
<div class="item">1</div><div class="item">2</div><div class="item">3</div>
<div class="item">4</div><div class="item">5</div><div class="item">6</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>Quick Reference Table</h2>
<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
<tr><th>Property / Value</th><th>Simple meaning</th></tr>
<tr><td>display: grid</td><td>Turns an element into a Grid container.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-template-columns</td><td>Defines columns.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-template-rows</td><td>Defines rows.</td></tr>
<tr><td>gap</td><td>Space between grid items.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-column</td><td>Controls an item's column span or position.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-row</td><td>Controls an item's row span or position.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-area</td><td>Places an item in a named area or sets its grid lines.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-template-areas</td><td>Creates named layout areas.</td></tr>
<tr><td>justify-items</td><td>Aligns items horizontally within cells.</td></tr>
<tr><td>align-items</td><td>Aligns items vertically within cells.</td></tr>
<tr><td>place-items</td><td>Combines align-items and justify-items.</td></tr>
<tr><td>justify-content</td><td>Aligns the grid horizontally.</td></tr>
<tr><td>align-content</td><td>Aligns the grid vertically.</td></tr>
<tr><td>place-content</td><td>Combines align-content and justify-content.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-auto-flow</td><td>Controls automatic item placement.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-auto-rows</td><td>Sizes automatically created rows.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid-auto-columns</td><td>Sizes automatically created columns.</td></tr>
<tr><td>grid</td><td>Shorthand for setting Grid layout.</td></tr>
<tr><td>repeat()</td><td>Repeats a track pattern.</td></tr>
<tr><td>minmax()</td><td>Sets a minimum and maximum track size.</td></tr>
<tr><td>fr</td><td>A fraction of available space.</td></tr>
</table>
</section>

</body>
</html>
